# SE-004: Repeated partial washing follows a geometric soluble-impurity budget
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 NaCl 0.001mol
add v1 SiO2 1g
new
decant v1 v2 0.8
dilute v1 80mL
new
decant v1 v3 0.8
dilute v1 80mL
new
decant v1 v4 0.8
inspect
